<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>App Intelligence Research Agent — 100-App Composio Integration Audit</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Evidence-backed integration and buildability audit of 100 applications across 10 categories for Composio.">
  <style>
    /* Scandinavian Design System: strictly neutral alpha-black on #FFFFFF / alpha-white on #0A0A0A.
       Zero warm/cool gray casts, zero gradients, zero heavy shadows, zero all-caps chrome. */
    :root {
      --canvas: #ffffff;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-alt: rgb(0 0 0 / 3.5%);
      --surface-row: rgb(0 0 0 / 2.5%);
      --ink-1: #000000;
      --ink-2: rgb(0 0 0 / 64%);
      --ink-3: rgb(0 0 0 / 56%);
      --border: rgb(0 0 0 / 10%);
      --border-strong: rgb(0 0 0 / 18%);
      --hover: rgb(0 0 0 / 5%);
      --pressed: rgb(0 0 0 / 9%);
      --solid-bg: #000000;
      --solid-ink: #ffffff;

      /* Semantic status colors (always paired with text labels) */
      --ok-ink: #15803d;
      --ok-bg: rgb(21 128 61 / 8%);
      --warn-ink: #a16207;
      --warn-bg: rgb(161 98 7 / 9%);
      --err-ink: #b91c1c;
      --err-bg: rgb(185 28 28 / 8%);
      --unk-ink: rgb(0 0 0 / 56%);
      --unk-bg: rgb(0 0 0 / 4%);

      --font-sans: "Inter Variable", "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      --radius: 8px;
      --radius-pill: 999px;
      --max-w: 1120px;
      --gutter: 48px;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
        --canvas: #0a0a0a;
        --surface: #121212;
        --surface-alt: rgb(255 255 255 / 4.5%);
        --surface-row: rgb(255 255 255 / 3%);
        --ink-1: #ffffff;
        --ink-2: rgb(255 255 255 / 60%);
        --ink-3: rgb(255 255 255 / 50%);
        --border: rgb(255 255 255 / 11%);
        --border-strong: rgb(255 255 255 / 20%);
        --hover: rgb(255 255 255 / 9%);
        --pressed: rgb(255 255 255 / 14%);
        --solid-bg: #ffffff;
        --solid-ink: #0a0a0a;

        --ok-ink: #4ade80;
        --ok-bg: rgb(74 222 128 / 12%);
        --warn-ink: #fbbf24;
        --warn-bg: rgb(251 191 36 / 12%);
        --err-ink: #f87171;
        --err-bg: rgb(248 113 113 / 12%);
        --unk-ink: rgb(255 255 255 / 50%);
        --unk-bg: rgb(255 255 255 / 6%);
      }
    }

    :root[data-theme="dark"] {
      --canvas: #0a0a0a;
      --surface: #121212;
      --surface-alt: rgb(255 255 255 / 4.5%);
      --surface-row: rgb(255 255 255 / 3%);
      --ink-1: #ffffff;
      --ink-2: rgb(255 255 255 / 60%);
      --ink-3: rgb(255 255 255 / 50%);
      --border: rgb(255 255 255 / 11%);
      --border-strong: rgb(255 255 255 / 20%);
      --hover: rgb(255 255 255 / 9%);
      --pressed: rgb(255 255 255 / 14%);
      --solid-bg: #ffffff;
      --solid-ink: #0a0a0a;

      --ok-ink: #4ade80;
      --ok-bg: rgb(74 222 128 / 12%);
      --warn-ink: #fbbf24;
      --warn-bg: rgb(251 191 36 / 12%);
      --err-ink: #f87171;
      --err-bg: rgb(248 113 113 / 12%);
      --unk-ink: rgb(255 255 255 / 50%);
      --unk-bg: rgb(255 255 255 / 6%);
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--canvas);
      color: var(--ink-1);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a { color: var(--ink-1); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--border-strong); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--ink-1); }
    :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ink-1); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }

    .wrap { max-width: var(--max-w); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--gutter); }

    /* Header */
    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 40;
      background: var(--canvas);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .topbar-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      min-height: 56px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 8px 0;
    }
    .brand {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      text-decoration: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink-2);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }
    .nav a:hover { color: var(--ink-1); background: var(--hover); }
    .topbar-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .export-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .export-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink-2);
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }
    .export-links a:hover { color: var(--ink-1); border-color: var(--border-strong); background: var(--hover); }

    button, select, input {
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--ink-1);
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 34px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: var(--hover); }
    .btn:active { background: var(--pressed); }

    /* Chapters */
    .chapter { padding: 80px 0; }
    .chapter--alt { background: var(--surface-alt); }
    .chapter-head { max-width: 68ch; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .chapter-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink-3);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }
    h1 .sub { color: var(--ink-2); }
    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 28px);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .lead { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 64ch; }

    /* Key-number strip */
    .kpi-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 28px 0;
      margin: 36px 0 40px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .kpi-val {
      font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 32px);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .kpi-label {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }
    .kpi-note {
      margin-top: 2px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-3);
    }

    /* Headline list */
    .headline-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 28px 48px;
    }
    .headline-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .headline-idx {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink-3);
      min-width: 24px;
      padding-top: 2px;
    }
    .headline-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 0 0 4px;
    }
    .headline-text {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }

    /* Opportunity matrix */
    .bucket-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .bucket-col {
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    }
    .bucket-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .bucket-count {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .bucket-desc {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }
    .chip-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--ink-1);
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .chip:hover { border-color: var(--border-strong); background: var(--hover); }
    .chip--gap {
      background: var(--solid-bg);
      color: var(--solid-ink);
      border-color: var(--solid-bg);
    }
    .chip--gap:hover { opacity: 0.88; background: var(--solid-bg); }
    .chip-score {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      opacity: 0.72;
    }
    .legend-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }
    .legend-swatch {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin-right: 6px;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    /* Charts */
    .chart-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 40px 48px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
    .chart-block h3 { margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .chart-sub { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); }
    .bar-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 1fr) 44px;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .bar-label { color: var(--ink-2); overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    .bar-track {
      height: 10px;
      background: var(--hover);
      border-radius: 3px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .bar-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--ink-1);
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    .bar-fill--muted { background: var(--ink-3); }
    .bar-val {
      text-align: right;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      color: var(--ink-1);
    }

    .split-2 > *, .bucket-grid > *, .chart-grid > *, .detail-grid > *, .kpi-strip > *, .headline-list > * {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    /* Tables & Heatmap */
    .table-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 13.5px;
    }
    th {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink-2);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    td {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .num {
      text-align: right;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .heat-cell {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Status badges (color + text + dot) */
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .badge::before {
      content: "";
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: currentColor;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .badge--ok { color: var(--ok-ink); background: var(--ok-bg); }
    .badge--warn { color: var(--warn-ink); background: var(--warn-bg); }
    .badge--err { color: var(--err-ink); background: var(--err-bg); }
    .badge--unk { color: var(--unk-ink); background: var(--unk-bg); border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong); }
    .badge--solid { color: var(--solid-ink); background: var(--solid-bg); }
    .badge--solid::before { display: none; }

    /* Filters */
    .filter-bar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(170px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .filter-bar input, .filter-bar select {
      height: 36px;
      padding: 0 10px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      width: 100%;
    }
    .filter-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }

    /* Explorer rows */
    .exp-row { cursor: pointer; }
    .exp-row:nth-child(4n+1) { background: var(--surface-row); }
    .exp-row:hover { background: var(--hover); }
    .exp-detail { display: none; background: var(--surface-alt); }
    .exp-detail.is-open { display: table-row; }
    .detail-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
      padding: 16px 8px;
    }
    .claim-item {
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .claim-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .claim-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .claim-name { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; }
    .claim-val { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .claim-quote {
      margin: 4px 0;
      padding-left: 10px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }
    .claim-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); word-break: break-word; }

    /* Two-column editorial splits */
    .split-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 40px 48px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    /* Disclosure / details */
    details {
      margin-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 12px;
    }
    summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink-1);
      padding: 4px 0;
    }

    /* Code blocks */
    pre {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      padding: 16px;
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.9em; }

    /* Inline SVG pipeline */
    .pipeline-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 16px 0;
    }
    .pipeline-svg {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 720px;
      height: auto;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 40px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ink-2);
    }
    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      :root { --gutter: 24px; }
      .chapter { padding: 56px 0; }
      .kpi-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .headline-list, .bucket-grid, .chart-grid, .split-2, .detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .kpi-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .bar-row { grid-template-columns: 112px minmax(0, 1fr) 36px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="wrap topbar-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#headlines">App Intelligence Audit</a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Page sections">
        <a href="#headlines">Headlines</a>
        <a href="#opportunities">Opportunities</a>
        <a href="#patterns">Patterns</a>
        <a href="#explorer">Explorer</a>
        <a href="#verification">Verification</a>
        <a href="#wrong">Where we were wrong</a>
        <a href="#architecture">How it was built</a>
        <a href="#reproduce">Proof</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="topbar-actions">
        <div class="export-links" aria-label="Agent-consumable exports">
          <a href="apps.json">apps.json</a>
          <a href="apps.csv">apps.csv</a>
          <a href="llms.txt">llms.txt</a>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn" id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle light and dark theme">Theme</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- 1. Headline patterns -->
    <section id="headlines" class="chapter">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="chapter-head">
          <div class="chapter-num">01 / Headline patterns</div>
          <h1>
            Integration intelligence across {{ analytics.summary.total_apps }} applications.
            <span class="sub">Evidence-backed, independently verified, and scored without LLMs.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Every claim carries a primary-source URL and verbatim quote, passes six automated verification loops (L1–L6) with an independent Meta Muse Spark verifier, and maps deterministically into Composio buildability buckets.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpi-strip">
          <div>
            <div class="kpi-val">{{ analytics.summary.total_apps }}</div>
            <div class="kpi-label">Apps audited</div>
            <div class="kpi-note">10 categories · {{ analytics.summary.composio_available }} in Composio catalog</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="kpi-val">{{ analytics.summary.self_serve_free }}%</div>
            <div class="kpi-label">Self-serve free dev access</div>
            <div class="kpi-note">{{ analytics.distributions.production_gate.gated_despite_free_dev }} still hit production gates</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="kpi-val">{{ analytics.summary.oauth2_supported }}%</div>
            <div class="kpi-label">Support OAuth 2.0</div>
            <div class="kpi-note">{{ analytics.distributions.auth_methods.multi_method_apps }} offer 2+ auth methods</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="kpi-val">
              {{ "%.1f"|format(acc1.overall.accuracy) }}% → {{ "%.1f"|format(acc2.overall.accuracy) }}% → {{ "%.1f"|format(accf.overall.accuracy) }}%
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-label">Golden accuracy (P1 → P2 → Final)</div>
            <div class="kpi-note">20 apps (120 claims) · Final is human-corrected</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ol class="headline-list">
          {% for h in analytics.headlines %}
          <li class="headline-item">
            <span class="headline-idx">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <div>
              <div class="headline-title">{{ h.title }}</div>
              <p class="headline-text">{{ h.text }}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. Opportunity matrix -->
    <section id="opportunities" class="chapter chapter--alt">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="chapter-head">
          <div class="chapter-num">02 / Opportunity matrix</div>
          <h2>Four deterministic buckets, commercial gates separated</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            Scores (0–10) are computed in Python from the five-dimension FR-04 rubric. Commercial gates (partner-gated, contact-sales, or partner program) route apps to Needs outreach regardless of technical score. Click any app chip to inspect its evidence and score breakdown.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legend-row">
          <span><span class="legend-swatch" style="background: var(--solid-bg);"></span>No Composio toolkit yet (immediate gap)</span>
          <span><span class="legend-swatch" style="border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); background: var(--surface);"></span>Existing Composio toolkit</span>
        </div>

        <div class="bucket-grid">
          <div class="bucket-col">
            <div class="bucket-head">
              <h3>Easy wins</h3>
              <span class="bucket-count">{{ analytics.opportunities.easy_wins_all|length }}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="bucket-desc">
              Score 8–10 with no commercial gate. <strong>{{ analytics.opportunities.easy_wins_without_composio|length }} lack a Composio toolkit</strong> and are ready to build without BD outreach.
            </p>
            <div class="chip-wrap">
              {% for a in analytics.opportunities.easy_wins_all %}
